<title>AUSTRALIA: Trade data allow for better year outcome-Costello.</title>
<headline>Trade data allow for better year outcome-Costello.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Tuesday June balance on goods and services data released earlier would allow a better than forecast year outcome.</p>
<p>&quot;They're good figures. We welcome them. They will probably allow us to finish the year in a better position than we forecast,&quot; Costello told reporters.</p>
</text>
